        "Description": "Hello 47\r\rYou&apos;ve been assigned to eliminate four members of the notorius group called &quot;The Black Node of New York&quot;. Together your targets stride towards controlling the entire inside-trading business in the US, and are in the belief that in the next five years, they shall have total monopoly of the illegal investment funds of northern states. Our client, Athena Savales has issued a contract towards the main men responsible for the upcoming storm against the economy.\r\rHappy Hunting 47.",
